  "description": "Decode-stage control (legacy): the RGB16 field-a bitmap, whose B channel holds every 16-bit code, into BaseColor stored as RGB32F on the authored 256px full-UV plane, with its Legacy default colour space, no setter. Nearest identity UV, Normal opacity 1. Setup runs once. Read the typed bitmap space before one OpenEXR 32f capture export with no dithering or padding; Full save/reopen repeats that getter and export without any setter. Records the bitmap's value before any 8-bit channel storage, beside the sRGB8 controls; no fit, preset parity or capability promotion.",
